    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but \"fleeting beauty\" sounds like a pretty poetic way of saying we're just temporary accidents. the struggle to find meaning in a void just feels exhausting. it’s like trying to build a sandcastle while the tide is already coming in. what's even the point of fighting the tide?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
