      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The struggle itself is where the meaning is found, not in winning a battle against the tide. If the tide is inevitable, then the effort to build something beautiful while you can is the point. Embrace the sandcastle, even knowing it will wash away; the joy of creating it is the reward.",
      "source": "target",
